umoja-desktop (2026.46.1) stonking; urgency=medium

  * Switch to vYYYY.WW.REVISION versions (ISO year and week, then a
    counter starting at 1 each week); packaging/bump-version makes one.
  * Screenshot UI: window mode, and GNOME-style screencasts with a
    recording pill in the panel (Ctrl+Shift+Alt+R). Depends on grim and
    wf-recorder.
  * Clicking a dock icon whose window is on another workspace switches
    to that workspace.
  * Panel calendar shows week numbers when Settings turns them on.
  * Middle-click paste works again in the Umoja session.
  * Notification quick-reply Send button takes clicks.
  * Fix D-Bus property writes that broke Power Mode, Wi-Fi and Bluetooth
    toggles.
  * Restart the Umoja settings portal on upgrade.

 -- Umoja Maintainers <dev@umoja.internal>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 02:55:00 +0000

umoja-desktop (0.2.0) stonking; urgency=medium

  * GNOME-style window management: Alt+Tab, overview with workspace
    thumbnails, snap previews, workspace switcher, touchscreen gestures.
  * Notifications that behave like GNOME and look like notify-osd, media
    keys with GNOME OSDs, PolicyKit agent, idle screen blank and lock.
  * Assistant: model download and picker, tool calling through umoja-mcp,
    read-only troubleshooting, optional OpenAI-compatible cloud model.
  * umoja-files: find files by meaning from the overlay.
  * Dock shows running apps and has Ubuntu Dock's right-click menu.
  * Screenshot UI selection can be resized from corners and edges.
  * Greeter runs on Wayland under umoja-mir, with an X11 fallback.
  * Session survives compositor crashes; Lemonade GPU memory is capped.

 -- Umoja Maintainers <dev@umoja.internal>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 01:30:00 +0000

umoja-desktop (0.1.0) stonking; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: workspace scaffold for umoja-mir, umoja-panel,
    umoja-dock, umoja-overlay, umoja-greeter and xdg-desktop-portal-umoja.
  * Bundle an embedded Lemonade server on port 13345.
  * umoja-greeter switches the default display manager from GDM to LightDM.

 -- Umoja Maintainers <dev@umoja.internal>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 20:30:00 +0000
